{"siren:A city archive has digitised its most frequently requested documents. Officials describe the portal as representative of local history. Yet requests have mainly come from established researchers; records used by smaller community groups remain largely uncatalogued. The portal improves access to a selection, not necessarily to the breadth of the archive.":"73f7979eeeedac80e859fd1ec2421c222bf51b92046b26deb71d3c8e43580900"}